[a (beautiful:1.5) landscape] 1 segment(s), 3 tokens -> a:1000 beautiful:1500 landscape:1000
[(dark:0.5) forest] 1 segment(s), 2 tokens -> dark:500 forest:1000
[((emphasis))] 1 segment(s), 1 tokens -> emphasis:1210
[mountain BREAK ocean] 2 segment(s), 1 tokens | 1 tokens -> mountain:1000 | ocean:1000
[eat BREAKFAST] 1 segment(s), 2 tokens -> eat:1000 BREAKFAST:1000
[(x:2) (y:1.25) (z:1.2555)] 1 segment(s), 3 tokens -> x:2000 y:1250 z:1255
[(w:99999999999999999999) (v:1.99999999999999999999)] 1 segment(s), 2 tokens -> w:9999999000 v:1999
apply weights to a 3-token prompt, dim 2, embeddings of 100: 100 100 200 200 100 100; BREAK alone and at the end: 1 1
